{"id":"H0878","lemma":"בְּאֵרָא","transliteration":"beera","sayIt":"be-e-ra","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Beera","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Asher living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.7.37;\nson of: Zophah (H6690);\nbrother of: Suah (H5477), Harnepher (H2774), Shual (H7777B), Beri (H1275), Imrah (H3236), Bezer (H1221H), Hod (H1936), Shamma (H8037H), Shilshah (H8030) and Ithran (H3506H)\n§ Beera = \"a well\"\na man of Asher","glosses":["beera"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":37,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Beera","kjv":"and Beera"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 7:37","note":"Bezer, Hod, Shamma, Shilshah, Ithran, and Beera.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H6690","lemma":"צוֹפַח","transliteration":"tsophach","gloss":"Zophah"},{"id":"H5477","lemma":"סוּחַ","transliteration":"suach","gloss":"Suah"},{"id":"H2774","lemma":"חַרְנֶ֫פֶר","transliteration":"charnepher","gloss":"Harnepher"},{"id":"H7777","lemma":"שׁוּעָל","transliteration":"shual","gloss":"Shual"},{"id":"H1275","lemma":"בֵּרִי","transliteration":"beri","gloss":"Beri"},{"id":"H3236","lemma":"יִמְרָה","transliteration":"yimrah","gloss":"Imrah"},{"id":"H1221","lemma":"בֶּ֫צֶר","transliteration":"betser","gloss":"Bezer"},{"id":"H1936","lemma":"הוֹד","transliteration":"hod","gloss":"Hod"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}